  <item>
    <title>011.钓鱼最难受的不是打龟，而是脱钩！｜Lure怪谈</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/678b1938fd38652366ddddf5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">678b1938fd38652366ddddf5</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 19 Jan 2025 03:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>- 冬天穿上涉水裤，一下水就蹿稀的痛？</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 驱车几百公里，发现自己没带齐装备？</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 自己的快乐老家被包抄了？</span></p><span></span><p><span>有什么钓鱼痛点你觉得很痛，别人却鲜少提及？</span></p><span></span><p><span>但「中鱼脱钩」一定是我们共同的“拍大腿”时刻！</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天我们就来聊聊：减少脱钩跑鱼，都能做点什么吧～</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>- 本周闲聊 -</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> 近期RED难民，让我不得不感叹「资源才是王道啊」！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="122">02:02</a> 2024年消费降级的厉害，各平台账单都没多花，最贵的消费就是是轮子了。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="247">04:07</a> 涉水裤究竟适合什么场景？别拿自己的安全开玩笑！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="344">5:44</a> &nbsp;路亚拍大腿的痛点，你都遇到过么……不打字了，都是泪（欢迎评论区讨论）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>- 内容提要：路亚不脱钩 -</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="882">14:42</a> 刺鱼是关键1：为什么我俩总是横向刺鱼？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="988">16:28</a> &nbsp;刺鱼是关键2：什么时候都需要刺鱼么？什么时候又需要补刺呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1134">18:54</a> 跑鱼原因1：虚线过多，刺鱼力传导差</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1265">21:05</a> 跑鱼原因2：卸力过紧，切线断线是小事，断杆飞杆……录下来一定能火hhh</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1339">22:19</a> 跑鱼原因3：不适配的饵，没吞进去导致的“脱钩“手感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> 跑鱼原因4：鱼活性不强的时候，收线太快没咬住，导致的“脱钩”手感</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>- 本期黑话 -</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>洗腮：中鱼时鱼跳出水面甩头摆尾想挣脱鱼钩</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6729e864b2eb246ec4d742c1/lkM-oWE6ganKyfbw03t0GLHZtgSL.m4a" length="24040230" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:24:46</itunes:duration>
